      ["Brownie base","Mix the oat flour, cocoa, maple syrup, coconut oil, almond milk and vanilla. Press into a lined tin and freeze 10 minutes."],
      ["Cheesecake layer","Beat the cream cheese, sweetener, vanilla and lemon juice with a hand mixer until smooth. Spread over the base and freeze 45 minutes."],
      ["Chocolate topping","Mix the cocoa, maple syrup, coconut oil and almond milk into a thick fudgy sauce and spread it over the top."],
